# The API image builds from the repo root (src/api-gateway-rs/Containerfile)
# so it can carry the service catalog and migrations. Send only what it uses:
# the rest includes Cargo's multi-GB target/ and local database folders.
*
!src/api-gateway-rs/Cargo.toml
!src/api-gateway-rs/Cargo.lock
!src/api-gateway-rs/crates
!src/api-gateway-rs/public
!src/api-gateway-rs/migrate.sh
!config
!infra/migrations
